playstyle = "Pays the ferryman: health for power, cards exhausted for good.
The toll: cards paid for in health rather than energy, strong effects for exhausting a card (ferried across), and gold that counts in a fight. Suggested cards: one costing 3 health and hitting hard, cards that exhaust a card from the hand for a bonus, a Power mending a little whenever a card is exhausted."
